833
01:04:10,840 --> 01:04:13,051
No, thank you for walking me home.

834
01:04:13,134 --> 01:04:15,845
You should go home. Thank you.

835
01:04:18,139 --> 01:04:19,390
It's slippery.

836
01:04:19,474 --> 01:04:20,933
